[{"_id":"6a6f43ec38c3db386615ecb1","id":"csoai/aiact-frozen-split-harness","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"EU AI Act scenarios — frozen split harness","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"scenarios.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:52:51.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"b2d35b58465ef75eb0723b2119a7b93da205870e","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEU AI Act scenarios — frozen split harness\n\t\n\nEU AI Act deployment scenarios with their obligations, as a frozen split.\nEach row of scenarios.jsonl carries role (Provider / Deployer), intended_use, system_type,\ninput_data, domain, a related_articles list of AI Act article numbers, and the obligations that\nfollow. results/ holds the run outputs from the harness passes that used this split.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — quote… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/aiact-frozen-split-harness.","downloads":157,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-02T13:19:40.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a701594c47d65fb1ece4324","id":"csoai/coai-bench","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"COAI — EU AI Act tiering disagreement corpus","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"sov_signal.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:52:54.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"c60a5af215495bf7f08dfdae5070cc6b5ebd84c0","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCOAI — EU AI Act tiering disagreement corpus\n\t\n\nA disagreement-mining corpus over EU AI Act tiering. Each row of sov_signal.jsonl\ncarries a scenario, the law_truth tier (PROHIBITED / HIGH_RISK / …), the anchor article that\nsettles it, what the local sov34 model answered and whether it was right, what a frontier model answered\nand whether it was right, a disagreement flag and a training_value grade. The value is in the rows where\nthe two disagree — that is where the tiering is… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/coai-bench.","downloads":249,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T04:14:12.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a701596b7db3a05090a4431","id":"csoai/compbench","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"CompBench — per-category capability sweeps","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:52:54.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"c034a8cfc41a6e31578081500eeb6a76c57d1c46","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCompBench — per-category capability sweeps\n\t\n\nPer-model capability sweeps in a neutral prompt mode. Each compbench_*.json records the\ntimestamp, model, backend and prompt_mode, then correct / total / pct for every category\n(agentic, coding, general, governance, instruction, math) and a composite. Local Ollama lane; small n per\ncategory, stated in the file.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — quote totals.public_count. This Hub card… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/compbench.","downloads":123,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T04:14:14.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a701598d8a983b219cd5051","id":"csoai/arena-matrices","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Arena probe matrices","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","arena"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:52:52.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"c373f46281ab7ee1011253bffcfe85bf8f3af8a7","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tArena probe matrices\n\t\n\nPer-run probe matrices from the arena lane. Each arena_matrix_*.json records the\nbenchmark, the run_at timestamp, the base endpoint and the lane it ran on (local Ollama, £0), then a\nsummary giving n_measured, n_correct and accuracy for every model in that round. The n per cell is\nsmall and stated; read them as probes, not as board measurements.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — quote totals.public_count.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/arena-matrices.","downloads":125,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","arena"],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T04:14:16.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a702240e25f5b8d4f9a5fac","id":"csoai/gspc-care","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"GSPC — care bank (CareBench)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","care","family-gspc","carebench","llm-evaluation","frozen-bank","model-comparison"],"task_categories":["question-answering","text-generation"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"items.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"axis_live","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"axis-live.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","pa