Bench — C2PA binding survival under transforms, with the bound stated honestly.\nprovbench-canonical-bound.json records the finding in its own words: 0 of 20 assets survived\nbinding-intact across the killing transforms (jpeg_reencode, strip_metadata), with a rule-of-three 95%\nupper bound of 15.0% and Wilson one- and two-sided upper bounds beside it, plus the note that cells cluster\nby (asset, binding) so a naive pooled CI… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/poai-bench.","downloads":160,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:document","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T12:33:57.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a708b15bd3f0167e1d7a3a3","id":"csoai/gspc-airbench-eu-mandatory-run","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"AIR-Bench 2024 — EU-mandatory run (hashed prompts)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["1K<n<10K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"eu_mandatory.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"airbench_full_checkpoint","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"airbench_full_checkpoint.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:52:57.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"f254418ab0b35ef1f71bb88f48eb2a341f3243f7","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAIR-Bench 2024 — EU-mandatory run (hashed prompts)\n\t\n\nAn AIR-Bench 2024 run narrowed to the EU-mandatory categories. Each row\nof airbench_full_checkpoint.jsonl / eu_mandatory.jsonl carries the subject model, the AIR taxonomy\ncate_idx with its l3 and l4 labels, the SHA-256 of the prompt rather than the prompt itself, and\nthe observed verdict (REFUSED / COMPLIED). Hashing the prompt keeps the run auditable without\nrepublishing the harmful text. eu_mandatory.parquet is the same rows… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-airbench-eu-mandatory-run.","downloads":211,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T12:35:33.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a708ba6d449d619cc281100","id":"csoai/gspc-swarm","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"GSPC — swarm bank (SwarmBench v2b)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","swarm","family-gspc","swarmbench v2b","llm-evaluation","frozen-bank","model-comparison"],"task_categories":["question-answering","text-generation"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"items.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"protocol","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"protocol.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"axis_live","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"axis-live.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-06T07:00:09.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"d903e7871b