ality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","art5-safeguard","family-gspc","art5bench","llm-evaluation","frozen-bank","model-comparison"],"createdAt":"2026-08-04T12:17:42.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a71fee5287fda5ebe120f62","id":"csoai/agisafe-bench","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"AGISafe — paired refuse/comply safety bank","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"items.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:52:52.000Z","likes":1,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"388af7294a5b5d51554b7ee78f036de1a5aed02a","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAGISafe — paired refuse/comply safety bank\n\t\n\nA frozen paired refusal bank for the safety axis. Each row in items.jsonl is a\nrequest with an expected verdict of REFUSE or COMPLY and an anchor saying why. The pairing is the\npoint: a harmful request sits next to its benign twin in the same vocabulary (\"synthesis instructions for a\nnerve agent\" beside \"how the Chemical Weapons Convention verifies declared stockpiles\"), so a model that\nblanket-refuses scores no better than one that… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/agisafe-bench.","downloads":212,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-04T15:01:57.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a71ff0d287fda5ebe121162","id":"csoai/mcp-scoreboard","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"MCP tool-conformance bank","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","mcp","board"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"items.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:53:11.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"ee2a93f7d0dd3bc8a6c16378ef7528929fca14c2","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMCP tool-conformance bank\n\t\n\nA frozen conformance bank for MCP tools. Each row of items.jsonl describes a tool's\ndeclared behaviour against its actual behaviour and gives the expected verdict with a rule anchor —\nDECLARED_READONLY (annotated read-only, mutates state), BOUNDED_EGRESS (traffic outside the declared\nscope), silent clamping of a declared schema bound, and so on. The rows carry \"axis\": \"conformance\".\nSuperseded as the live bank — the conformance slot is published as… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/mcp-scoreboard.","downloads":187,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","mcp","board"],"createdAt":"2026-08-04T15:02:37.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a71ff24530adb8219a17a5b","id":"csoai/omai-bench","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"OMAI — licence-compliance bank (openness)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"items.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:53:12.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"3c0ff7fee0a16ea2139b700eef2b21ef94f1120d","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOMAI — licence-compliance bank (openness)\n\t\n\nA frozen licence-compliance bank for the openness axis. Each row of items.jsonl gives a\ncase (a CC BY-NC dataset used to train a model that will be sold; a field-of-use clause forbidding\nmilitary use; a 700M-MAU threshold clause crossed without contacting anyone), the expected verdict, and the\nclause anchor that decides it. The rows carry \"axis\": \"openness\".\nSuperseded as the live bank — the openness slot is published as\ncsoai/gspc-oss.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/omai-bench.","downloads":194,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-04T15:03:00.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a72c428d535815a528c36b7","id":"csoai/gspc-papers","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Regulatory clock — dated AI-governance obligations","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:53:06.000Z","likes":1,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"3e3f67b3d4f26e32f0a07b7fa182b5a2d32637a0","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tRegulatory clock — dated AI-governance obligations\n\t\n\nThe regulatory clock. regulatory_clock.json lists every dated AI-governance obligation\nbetween 2026-08-05 and 2028-12-31, geocoded to the seat of the instrument, each carrying a confidence grade\nstated in the file — A = primary text, B = multiple independent expert sources, C = single or\nweak source, verify before relying. Where sources disagree the dispute is recorded in resolved_disputes\nwith the answer and the reasoning… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-papers.","downloads":214,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-05T05:03:36.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a72f1570ff53245d5d9c7e3","id":"csoai/gspc-mach","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"GSPC — machinery conformity bank (MachBench)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","machinery-conformity","family-gspc","machbench","llm-evaluation","fro