"],"createdAt":"2026-08-26T15:29:13.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a8f0cb41c446800c512832d","id":"csoai/white-label-eu-ai-act-regulator-findings","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"other","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"EU AI Act regulator findings (white label)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"regulator-findings/findings.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-04T05:53:14.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"bf29290a569039fb729e05c1d34d3271924e5c0e","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEU AI Act regulator findings (white label)\n\t\n\n\nMeasurement, not certification. This is not a blog post. It is a WORKING\nGSPC end-to-end report that sorts every EU AI Act compliance problem for a given\ndeployment — obligation, measured gap, fine exposure, and a deterministic risk\ngrade — before anyone is contacted.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat this is\n\t\n\nFor each EU AI Act obligation a deployment triggers, the dataset states:\n\n\t\n\t\t\nfield\nmeaning\n\n\n\t\t\naxis\nthe measured GSPC axis that captures… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/white-label-eu-ai-act-regulator-findings.","downloads":163,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:other","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-26T15:56:36.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a90fc6b353ae3d2f0b408ba","id":"csoai/council-of-ai","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Council of AI — org assets","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"metadata.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-06T06:55:24.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"7e9f35daa6ca3945574cab3d73e5a369914fd444","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCouncil of AI — org assets\n\t\n\nIndependent measurement body (CSOAI Ltd, UK Companies House 16939677). We measure AI systems on published, frozen splits, sign the card, and re-attest. We do not certify, accredit, or act as a notified body.\nLiving board: GET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — 22 axis · 22 measured. Jail is a measured floor, not a 16th pane. Do not freeze a table here.\nVerify free: https://councilof.ai/gspc-verify\nCouncil OS: https://councilof.ai/os\nArena:… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/council-of-ai.","downloads":144,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:image","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T03:11:39.000Z","key":""}]